[[Lava dragon]]s attack with both [[Melee]] and [[dragonfire]], so as long as you maintain distance, you'll be safe from their attacks. As you'll be [[safespotting]], your biggest threat is [[player killer]]s. '''You want to keep risk to a minimum at all times!'''

<tabber>
Magic=

The [[accursed sceptre]] is the most effective magic weapon to use against lava dragons. Due to the fact that Lava dragons are very weak to Magic, it's also most effective weapon outclassing ranged alternatives. However, the revenant ether adds a considerable amount of risk, making the player a somewhat lucrative target to player killers. This is somewhat mitigated by the fact that only gear with Magic damage bonuses matter for maximizing DPS (Occult necklace, Imbued god cape, etc.) and the rest can simply be tank gear or Prayer bonus equipment. In addition, the high magic bonus from this equipment enables players to escape from PKers more easily by using Entangle or Ice Barrage.

A strong alternative is the [[Eye of Ayak]], providing similar dps while avoiding the risk revenant ether.
<br></br><p>
'''Note:''' Only bring items that you are comfortable with losing. Ensure PK skull prevention is turned on in the settings as added security. It is recommended that the player only brings three items of high value, to ensure they are protected. Four can be brought if using [[Protect item]] with [[blighted super restore]], though as the isle is multi-combat, you may be easily [[Smite]]d for the fourth item. While bloodbark is recommended, it does have a relatively high cost so keep this in mind and check items lost on death before entering the Wilderness. 

